esxictl is an ESXi hypervisor host management bash application version 1.0.0 free edition.

Usage: esxictl <command>

Commands:
	version			Show esxictl version information
	describe		Show esxictl description information
	setup			Set up and define the required esxictl settings
	debug			Set on/off debug log (useful for network and application issues debug, esxi API detailed content and others)
	themes			Set up current esxictl colour theme
	manage			Manage an ESXi hypervisor host

	help			Show this help message

Examples:
	esxictl version
	esxictl help
	esxictl
	esxictl	setup
	esxictl debug on
	esxictl debug off
	esxictl themes
	esxictl	describe
	esxictl	manage
